{"id":"ed30f132c1f52e7a","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map.md","title":"ZFC Metric Lipschitz Map","display":"df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map — ZFC Metric Lipschitz Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map"],"display":"df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map — ZFC Metric Lipschitz Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-metric.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-metric-lipschitz-map — ZFC Metric Lipschitz Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,d_X)\">\\((X,d_X)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Y,d_Y)\">\\((Y,d_Y)\\)</span> (metric spaces, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Metric}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Metric}_S\\)</span> (metric predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"267957a097ff75bf\" href=\"?note=267957a097ff75bf\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-metric.md\">../batch18/58-df-metric.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:X\\to Y\">\\(f:X\\to Y\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (Lipschitz constant)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricLipschitzMap}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricLipschitzMap}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}lipschitz\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricLipschitzMap}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_Y,Y)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land L\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))\\leq L\\,d_X(x,y))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}lipschitz\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricLipschitzMap}_S(f,X,Y,d_X,d_Y,L)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_X,X)\\land\\mathrm{Metric}_S(d_Y,Y)\\land f:X\\to Y\\land L\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(d_Y(f(x),f(y))\\leq L\\,d_X(x,y))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":".